{%- comment -%}
  Where to SEE this directory: the pages that render it (its visualisers),
  as the caller resolved them. Included by subgraph.liquid; reads
  `visualisers` (title, href, undetermined) and `missingVisualiser`.

  A visualiser found with no address prints *could not determine* and why;
  a directory that owes one and has none says so. Both are findings in the
  writer's plan — a printed absence and a real one must not look alike, and
  neither may look like a directory that simply was never asked.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if visualisers.size > 0 -%}
**See it rendered:** {% for v in visualisers -%}
{%- if v.href != "" -%}[{{ v.title }}]({{ v.href }}){%- else -%}{{ v.title }} (_could not determine its address: {{ v.undetermined }}_){%- endif -%}
{%- unless forloop.last %} · {% endunless -%}
{%- endfor %}
{%- elsif missingVisualiser -%}
_No visualiser renders this directory, though its kind needs one._
{%- endif -%}
